  "body": "And more clearly denote existing issues.\n\nThis would help #5491. An alternative approach is that we overload between an element and a browsing context group as we could get the group from the element. (Or allow the group to be null.) This seems a bit clearer.\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5583/browsers.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 1, 2020, 3:12 PM UTC (3511b20)\">/browsers.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5583/cd33503...3511b20/browsers.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 1, 2020, 3:12 PM UTC (3511b20)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5583/browsing-the-web.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 1, 2020, 3:12 PM UTC (3511b20)\">/browsing-the-web.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5583/cd33503...3511b20/browsing-the-web.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 1, 2020, 3:12 PM UTC (3511b20)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5583/iframe-embed-object.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 1, 2020, 3:12 PM UTC (3511b20)\">/iframe-embed-object.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5583/cd33503...3511b20/iframe-embed-object.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 1, 2020, 3:12 PM UTC (3511b20)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5583/links.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 1, 2020, 3:12 PM UTC (3511b20)\">/links.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5583/cd33503...3511b20/links.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 1, 2020, 3:12 PM UTC (3511b20)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5583/origin.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jun 1, 2